(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Çelik Yaya Köprüsü İmalatı: EXC3, Görünür Kaynaklar, Korozyon ve Sevkiyat Parçaları | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Çelik yaya köprüleri, üst geçitler ve tesis içi bağlantı köprülerinin imalatı: EN 1090 uygulama sınıfı, kaynak kalitesi ve NDT, görünür yüzeyler, ISO 12944 korozyon koruması, nakliye parçalarına bölme ve atölyede deneme montajı.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Çelik yaya köprüsü imalatı","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Çelik Yapı","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Çelik Yaya Köprüsü İmalatı: EXC3, Görünür Kaynaklar, Korozyon ve Sevkiyat Parçaları","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Yaya köprüsü","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 dk okuma","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Belediye üst geçitleri, park ve dere geçişleri, fabrikalarda iki bina arasını bağlayan kapalı köprüler… Çelik yaya köprüleri hem taşıyıcı hem de göz önünde olan yapılardır. Bu yüzden imalatçıdan iki şey birden beklenir: köprü kalitesinde kaynak ve dokümantasyon, bir de kamuya açık bir yapıya yakışan temiz görünüm.</p>\n<h2>Uygulama Sınıfı ve Belgeler</h2>\n<p>Avrupa'da köprüler genellikle EN 1090-2'ye göre EXC3 uygulama sınıfında istenir; sınıfı proje belirler (bkz. <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3 nedir</a>). Bu sınıfta kaynak koordinasyonu, malzeme izlenebilirliği, nitelikli prosedürler ve daha yüksek NDT oranları gerekir. Teslimde malzeme sertifikaları, WPS/WPQR, kaynakçı sertifikaları, NDT raporları, boyutsal raporlar ve kaplama kayıtları içeren bir imalat dosyası beklenir.</p>\n<h2>Taşıyıcı Sistem</h2>\n<p>Yaya köprüleri kafes kiriş, I kiriş veya kutu kiriş (bkz. <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">kutu kiriş imalatı</a>) olarak tasarlanabilir. Yaya köprülerinde titreşim ve yürüme konforu tasarımda önemlidir; mühendis bunları hesapta değerlendirir. İmalatçının işi kesitleri, ters sehimi ve birleşim detaylarını çizime uygun üretmektir.</p>\n<h2>Görünür Kaynaklar ve Yüzey</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Görünür dikişlerin profili, sıçrantı ve taşlama derecesi siparişte tanımlanmalıdır; \"temiz görünüm\" ifadesi tek başına yeterli değildir.</li>\n<li>Kenar yuvarlatma ve kaynak hazırlığı, kaplamanın kalıcılığı için önemlidir (bkz. <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">ISO 8501-3 hazırlık dereceleri</a>).</li>\n<li>Su biriktiren cepler ve kapalı olmayan boşluklar tasarımda önlenmelidir.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Korozyon Koruması</h2>\n<p>Dış ortam ve uzun ömür beklentisi nedeniyle köprülerde kaplama sistemi ISO 12944'e göre ortam sınıfı ve dayanım süresiyle tanımlanır (bkz. <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 korozyon sınıfları</a>). Sıcak daldırma galvaniz ve üzerine boya (dupleks sistem) sık kullanılır; galvaniz banyosunun ölçüleri parça bölümlemesini etkiler.</p>\n<h2>Nakliye ve Montaj</h2>\n<p>Köprü, karayolu ölçülerine ve galvaniz banyosuna sığacak parçalara bölünür; ekler cıvatalı veya şantiye kaynaklı olarak tasarlanır. Kritik projelerde atölyede deneme montajı yapılarak ek yerlerinin uyumu kontrol edilir; parçalar montaj sırasına göre işaretlenir.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Köprü kirişlerini ve kafes elemanlarını çizime göre kaynaklıyor, VT ve UT'yi ISO 9712 Seviye 2 personelimizle yapıyoruz. Kesim, galvaniz, boya, nakliye ve montajı iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Çelik konstrüksiyon →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Yaya köprüsünde hangi EN 1090 sınıfı istenir?</h3><p>Sınıfı proje belirler; Avrupa'da köprüler genellikle EXC3 ile istenir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Görünür kaynaklar nasıl tanımlanmalı?</h3><p>Dikiş profili, sıçrantı ve taşlama derecesi siparişte açıkça yazılmalı.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Köprülerde hangi kaplama kullanılır?</h3><p>ISO 12944'e göre seçilen sistem; galvaniz üzeri boya (dupleks) yaygındır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Köprü nasıl taşınır?</h3><p>Karayolu ve galvaniz banyosu ölçülerine göre parçalara bölünür, sahada birleştirilir.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Yaya köprüsü projeniz mi var?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Proje ve imalat resimlerini gönderin; imalat teklifimizi hazırlayalım.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_exc3_h1":"EN 1090 EXC3 Nedir? Yapısal Çelik CE İşaretlemesi Rehberi","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korozyon Sınıfları C1–C5 ve CX: Kaynaklı Çelik Parçada Boya Sistemi Seçimi","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Kutu Kiriş (Box Girder) İmalatı: Kapalı Kesitte Kaynak Sırası, Diyaframlar ve Son Kapak","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Çelik Konstrüksiyon İmalat: Tasarımdan Montaja"},"en":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Steel Footbridge Fabrication: EXC3, Visible Welds, Corrosion Protection and Transport Segments | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Fabricating steel footbridges, pedestrian overpasses and plant link bridges: EN 1090 execution class, weld quality and NDT, visible surfaces, ISO 12944 corrosion protection, transport segments and trial assembly.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Steel footbridge fabrication","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Product Guide · Steel Structures","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Steel Footbridge Fabrication: EXC3, Visible Welds, Corrosion Protection and Transport Segments","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Footbridges","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min read","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Municipal overpasses, park and river crossings, enclosed bridges linking two factory buildings: steel footbridges are both load-bearing and on show. The fabricator is expected to deliver two things at once: bridge-grade welding and documentation, and a clean appearance fit for a public structure.</p>\n<h2>Execution Class and Documents</h2>\n<p>In Europe bridges are usually specified in execution class EXC3 under EN 1090-2; the project sets the class (see <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">what is EN 1090 EXC3</a>). This class requires welding coordination, material traceability, qualified procedures and higher NDT rates. Delivery includes a manufacturing record with material certificates, WPS/WPQR, welder certificates, NDT, dimensional and coating records.</p>\n<h2>Structural System</h2>\n<p>Footbridges can be trusses, I-girders or box girders (see <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">box girder fabrication</a>). Vibration and walking comfort matter in design and are handled by the engineer. The fabricator's job is to produce sections, camber and connection details as drawn.</p>\n<h2>Visible Welds and Surfaces</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profile, spatter and grinding level of visible welds must be specified in the order; \"clean appearance\" alone is not enough.</li>\n<li>Edge rounding and weld preparation matter for coating durability (see <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">ISO 8501-3 preparation grades</a>).</li>\n<li>Water traps and open pockets should be designed out.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Corrosion Protection</h2>\n<p>Given outdoor exposure and long life expectations, the coating system is defined under ISO 12944 by corrosivity category and durability (see <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 corrosivity categories</a>). Hot-dip galvanising plus paint (duplex) is common; galvanising bath dimensions affect how the bridge is split.</p>\n<h2>Transport and Erection</h2>\n<p>The bridge is split into pieces that fit road limits and the galvanising bath; splices are designed as bolted or site welded. On critical projects a trial assembly in the shop checks splice fit, and parts are marked in erection sequence.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld bridge girders and truss members to drawing; VT and UT are done by our ISO 9712 Level 2 staff. Cutting, galvanising, painting, transport and erection are coordinated with our partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Steel construction →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which EN 1090 class for a footbridge?</h3><p>The project sets it; in Europe bridges are usually EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>How should visible welds be specified?</h3><p>State weld profile, spatter and grinding level explicitly in the order.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which coating is used on bridges?</h3><p>A system chosen under ISO 12944; duplex (galvanising plus paint) is common.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>How is a bridge transported?</h3><p>Split to fit road and galvanising bath limits, joined on site.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Have a footbridge project?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Send design and shop drawings; we will prepare our fabrication quote.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_exc3_h1":"What Is EN 1090 EXC3? Structural Steel CE Marking Guide","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Corrosivity Categories C1–C5 and CX: Choosing a Coating System for Welded Steel","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Box Girder Fabrication: Welding Sequence, Diaphragms and the Closing Plate","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Steel Structure Manufacturing: From Design to Erection"},"de":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Fußgängerbrücken aus Stahl fertigen: EXC3, sichtbare Nähte, Korrosionsschutz und Transportstücke | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Fertigung von Stahl-Fußgängerbrücken, Überführungen und Verbindungsbrücken im Werk: Ausführungsklasse nach EN 1090, Nahtqualität und ZfP, Sichtflächen, Korrosionsschutz nach ISO 12944, Transportstücke und Probemontage.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Fußgängerbrücken aus Stahl","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Stahlbau","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Fußgängerbrücken aus Stahl fertigen: EXC3, sichtbare Nähte, Korrosionsschutz und Transportstücke","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Fußgängerbrücken","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Kommunale Überführungen, Park- und Bachquerungen, geschlossene Verbindungsbrücken zwischen Werkshallen: Stahl-Fußgängerbrücken sind tragend und sichtbar zugleich. Vom Fertiger wird beides erwartet: Brückenqualität bei Schweißen und Dokumentation sowie ein sauberes Erscheinungsbild für ein öffentliches Bauwerk.</p>\n<h2>Ausführungsklasse und Unterlagen</h2>\n<p>In Europa werden Brücken meist in EXC3 nach EN 1090-2 ausgeschrieben; die Klasse legt das Projekt fest (siehe <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Gefordert sind Schweißaufsicht, Rückverfolgbarkeit, qualifizierte Verfahren und höhere ZfP-Umfänge. Zur Lieferung gehört eine Herstelldokumentation mit Zeugnissen, WPS/WPQR, Schweißerprüfungen, ZfP-, Maß- und Beschichtungsprotokollen.</p>\n<h2>Tragsystem</h2>\n<p>Fußgängerbrücken können als Fachwerk, I-Träger oder Kastenträger ausgeführt werden (siehe <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">Kastenträger</a>). Schwingungen und Gehkomfort sind Bemessungsthemen des Tragwerksplaners. Der Fertiger setzt Querschnitte, Überhöhung und Anschlüsse zeichnungsgetreu um.</p>\n<h2>Sichtbare Nähte und Oberflächen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nahtprofil, Spritzer und Schleifgrad sichtbarer Nähte in der Bestellung festlegen; „sauberes Aussehen\" allein genügt nicht.</li>\n<li>Kantenverrundung und Nahtvorbereitung sind wichtig für die Haltbarkeit der Beschichtung (siehe <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">ISO 8501-3 Vorbereitungsgrade</a>).</li>\n<li>Wassersäcke und offene Taschen konstruktiv vermeiden.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Korrosionsschutz</h2>\n<p>Wegen Außenbewitterung und langer Lebensdauer wird das Beschichtungssystem nach ISO 12944 mit Korrosivitätskategorie und Schutzdauer festgelegt (siehe <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 Kategorien</a>). Feuerverzinkung plus Beschichtung (Duplex) ist verbreitet; die Kesselmaße beeinflussen die Stückelung.</p>\n<h2>Transport und Montage</h2>\n<p>Die Brücke wird in straßen- und kesseltaugliche Stücke geteilt; Stöße werden geschraubt oder baustellengeschweißt geplant. Bei kritischen Projekten prüft eine Probemontage im Werk die Passung; Teile werden in Montagereihenfolge gekennzeichnet.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Brückenträger und Fachwerkstäbe nach Zeichnung; VT und UT führt unser Personal mit ISO 9712 Stufe 2 durch. Zuschnitt, Verzinkung, Beschichtung, Transport und Montage koordinieren wir mit Partnern. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stahlbau →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welche EN-1090-Klasse für Fußgängerbrücken?</h3><p>Das Projekt legt sie fest; Brücken in Europa meist EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wie werden Sichtnähte spezifiziert?</h3><p>Nahtprofil, Spritzer und Schleifgrad ausdrücklich in der Bestellung.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welcher Korrosionsschutz?</h3><p>System nach ISO 12944; Duplex ist verbreitet.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wie wird transportiert?</h3><p>In straßen- und kesseltaugliche Stücke geteilt, vor Ort gefügt.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Eine Fußgängerbrücke geplant?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Senden Sie Entwurf und Werkstattzeichnungen; wir bieten die Fertigung an.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_exc3_h1":"Was ist EN 1090 EXC3? Leitfaden zur CE-Kennzeichnung von Stahlkonstruktionen","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korrosivitätskategorien C1–C5 und CX: Beschichtungssystem für geschweißte Stahlteile","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Kastenträger fertigen: Schweißfolge, Schotte und das letzte Deckblech","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stahlkonstruktion: Von der Konstruktion zur Montage"},"es":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Fabricación de pasarelas peatonales de acero: EXC3, soldaduras vistas, corrosión y tramos de transporte | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Fabricación de pasarelas peatonales, pasos elevados y puentes de conexión entre naves: clase de ejecución EN 1090, calidad de soldadura y END, superficies vistas, protección ISO 12944, tramos de transporte y premontaje.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Pasarelas peatonales de acero","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Guía de producto · Estructuras de acero","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Fabricación de pasarelas peatonales de acero: EXC3, soldaduras vistas, corrosión y tramos de transporte","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Pasarelas peatonales","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min de lectura","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Pasos elevados municipales, cruces de parques y ríos, pasarelas cerradas entre naves: las pasarelas de acero son portantes y visibles a la vez. Al taller se le pide calidad de puente en soldadura y documentación, y un aspecto limpio propio de una obra pública.</p>\n<h2>Clase de ejecución y documentos</h2>\n<p>En Europa los puentes suelen especificarse en EXC3 según EN 1090-2; la clase la fija el proyecto (ver <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">qué es EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Exige coordinación de soldadura, trazabilidad, procedimientos cualificados y más END. La entrega incluye dossier con certificados, WPS/WPQR, homologaciones de soldadores, informes de END, dimensionales y de pintura.</p>\n<h2>Sistema estructural</h2>\n<p>Pueden ser celosías, vigas en I o vigas cajón (ver <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">vigas cajón</a>). Vibraciones y confort al caminar son cuestiones de diseño del ingeniero. El taller fabrica secciones, contraflechas y uniones según plano.</p>\n<h2>Soldaduras vistas y superficies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Perfil, proyecciones y grado de amolado de las soldaduras vistas deben fijarse en el pedido; \"aspecto limpio\" no basta.</li>\n<li>Redondeo de aristas y preparación influyen en la durabilidad de la pintura (ver <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">grados ISO 8501-3</a>).</li>\n<li>Evitar en diseño zonas que retengan agua.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Protección anticorrosiva</h2>\n<p>El sistema se define según ISO 12944 por categoría de corrosividad y durabilidad (ver <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">categorías ISO 12944</a>). El sistema dúplex (galvanizado más pintura) es habitual; el tamaño de la cuba condiciona la división.</p>\n<h2>Transporte y montaje</h2>\n<p>La pasarela se divide en tramos aptos para carretera y cuba; los empalmes se diseñan atornillados o soldados en obra. En proyectos críticos se premonta en taller para comprobar los empalmes y se marcan las piezas en orden de montaje.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos vigas y barras de celosía según plano; VT y UT los realiza nuestro personal ISO 9712 Nivel 2. Corte, galvanizado, pintura, transporte y montaje se coordinan con socios. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Estructuras de acero →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué clase EN 1090 para una pasarela?</h3><p>La fija el proyecto; en Europa los puentes suelen ser EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cómo especificar soldaduras vistas?</h3><p>Indicando perfil, proyecciones y grado de amolado en el pedido.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué protección se usa?</h3><p>Un sistema según ISO 12944; el dúplex es habitual.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cómo se transporta?</h3><p>En tramos aptos para carretera y cuba, unidos en obra.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"¿Tiene un proyecto de pasarela?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Envíe proyecto y planos de taller; prepararemos la oferta de fabricación.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_exc3_h1":"¿Qué es EN 1090 EXC3? Guía de Marcado CE para Estructuras de Acero","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorías de corrosividad C1–C5 y CX: elegir el sistema de pintura para acero soldado","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Fabricación de vigas cajón: secuencia de soldadura, diafragmas y chapa de cierre","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabricación de Estructuras Metálicas: del Diseño al Montaje"},"fr":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Fabrication de passerelles piétonnes en acier : EXC3, soudures apparentes, anticorrosion et tronçons de transport | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Fabrication de passerelles piétonnes, franchissements et passerelles de liaison entre bâtiments : classe d'exécution EN 1090, qualité de soudage et CND, surfaces apparentes, protection ISO 12944, tronçons et pré-assemblage.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Passerelles piétonnes en acier","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Guide produit · Charpente métallique","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Fabrication de passerelles piétonnes en acier : EXC3, soudures apparentes, anticorrosion et tronçons de transport","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Passerelles piétonnes","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min de lecture","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Passerelles urbaines, franchissements de parcs et de rivières, passerelles couvertes entre deux bâtiments d'usine : les passerelles acier sont à la fois porteuses et exposées au regard. Le fabricant doit livrer une qualité de soudage et de documentation digne d'un ouvrage d'art, et un aspect soigné pour un ouvrage public.</p>\n<h2>Classe d'exécution et documents</h2>\n<p>En Europe, les ponts sont généralement prescrits en EXC3 selon l'EN 1090-2 ; c'est le projet qui fixe la classe (voir <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Elle exige coordination en soudage, traçabilité, modes opératoires qualifiés et taux de CND plus élevés. La livraison comprend un dossier de fabrication : certificats, DMOS/QMOS, qualifications soudeurs, rapports CND, dimensionnels et peinture.</p>\n<h2>Système porteur</h2>\n<p>Treillis, poutres en I ou caissons (voir <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">poutres caissons</a>). Vibrations et confort à la marche relèvent du calcul de l'ingénieur. Le fabricant réalise sections, contre-flèches et assemblages conformes au plan.</p>\n<h2>Soudures apparentes et surfaces</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profil, projections et degré de meulage des soudures visibles doivent être précisés à la commande ; « aspect soigné » ne suffit pas.</li>\n<li>Arrondi des arêtes et préparation conditionnent la durabilité de la peinture (voir <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">degrés ISO 8501-3</a>).</li>\n<li>Supprimer dès la conception les zones de rétention d'eau.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Protection anticorrosion</h2>\n<p>Le système est défini selon l'ISO 12944 par catégorie de corrosivité et durabilité (voir <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">catégories ISO 12944</a>). Le système duplex (galvanisation plus peinture) est courant ; la taille du bain influe sur le découpage.</p>\n<h2>Transport et montage</h2>\n<p>La passerelle est découpée en tronçons compatibles route et bain ; les jonctions sont boulonnées ou soudées sur site. Pour les projets sensibles, un pré-assemblage en atelier vérifie les jonctions, et les pièces sont repérées dans l'ordre de montage.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons poutres et barres de treillis sur plan ; VT et UT sont réalisés par notre personnel ISO 9712 niveau 2. Découpe, galvanisation, peinture, transport et montage sont coordonnés avec nos partenaires. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Construction métallique →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle classe EN 1090 pour une passerelle ?</h3><p>Fixée par le projet ; en Europe, souvent EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Comment spécifier les soudures apparentes ?</h3><p>Profil, projections et meulage précisés à la commande.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle protection ?</h3><p>Un système ISO 12944 ; le duplex est courant.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Comment transporter ?</h3><p>En tronçons compatibles route et bain, assemblés sur site.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Un projet de passerelle ?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Envoyez projet et plans d'atelier ; nous chiffrerons la fabrication.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_exc3_h1":"Qu'est-ce que EN 1090 EXC3 ? Guide du Marquage CE des Structures Métalliques","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 catégories de corrosivité C1–C5 et CX : choisir le système de peinture pour l’acier soudé","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Fabrication de poutres caissons : séquence de soudage, diaphragmes et tôle de fermeture","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabrication de Charpentes Métalliques : du Calcul au Montage"},"it":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Produzione di passerelle pedonali in acciaio: EXC3, saldature a vista, anticorrosione e conci di trasporto | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Produzione di passerelle pedonali, sovrappassi e passerelle di collegamento tra capannoni: classe di esecuzione EN 1090, qualità di saldatura e CND, superfici a vista, protezione ISO 12944, conci e premontaggio.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Passerelle pedonali in acciaio","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Guida prodotto · Carpenteria metallica","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Produzione di passerelle pedonali in acciaio: EXC3, saldature a vista, anticorrosione e conci di trasporto","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Passerelle pedonali","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min di lettura","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Sovrappassi comunali, attraversamenti di parchi e corsi d'acqua, passerelle chiuse tra due capannoni: le passerelle in acciaio sono portanti e in vista allo stesso tempo. A chi produce si chiede qualità da ponte in saldatura e documentazione, e un aspetto pulito adatto a un'opera pubblica.</p>\n<h2>Classe di esecuzione e documenti</h2>\n<p>In Europa i ponti sono di norma richiesti in EXC3 secondo EN 1090-2; la classe la stabilisce il progetto (vedi <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Servono coordinamento della saldatura, tracciabilità, procedimenti qualificati e percentuali di CND più alte. Alla consegna si fornisce un fascicolo con certificati, WPS/WPQR, patentini, rapporti CND, dimensionali e di verniciatura.</p>\n<h2>Sistema strutturale</h2>\n<p>Reticolari, travi a I o a cassone (vedi <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">travi a cassone</a>). Vibrazioni e comfort di camminata sono temi di progetto dell'ingegnere. Chi produce realizza sezioni, controfrecce e giunti come a disegno.</p>\n<h2>Saldature a vista e superfici</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profilo, spruzzi e grado di molatura delle saldature visibili vanno specificati nell'ordine; \"aspetto pulito\" da solo non basta.</li>\n<li>Arrotondamento degli spigoli e preparazione incidono sulla durata della verniciatura (vedi <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">gradi ISO 8501-3</a>).</li>\n<li>Evitare in progetto ristagni d'acqua.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Protezione anticorrosiva</h2>\n<p>Il ciclo si definisce secondo ISO 12944 per categoria di corrosività e durabilità (vedi <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">categorie ISO 12944</a>). Il sistema duplex (zincatura più verniciatura) è comune; le dimensioni della vasca condizionano la suddivisione.</p>\n<h2>Trasporto e montaggio</h2>\n<p>La passerella si divide in conci compatibili con strada e vasca; i giunti sono bullonati o saldati in cantiere. Nei progetti critici si esegue un premontaggio in officina per verificare i giunti e si marcano i pezzi in sequenza di montaggio.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo travi e aste reticolari su disegno; VT e UT sono eseguiti dal nostro personale ISO 9712 livello 2. Taglio, zincatura, verniciatura, trasporto e montaggio sono coordinati con i partner. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Carpenteria metallica →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale classe EN 1090 per una passerella?</h3><p>La stabilisce il progetto; in Europa i ponti sono spesso EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Come specificare le saldature a vista?</h3><p>Profilo, spruzzi e molatura indicati nell'ordine.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale protezione?</h3><p>Un ciclo ISO 12944; il duplex è comune.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Come si trasporta?</h3><p>In conci compatibili con strada e vasca, uniti in cantiere.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Avete un progetto di passerella?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Inviate progetto e disegni costruttivi; quoteremo la produzione.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_exc3_h1":"Cos'è la EN 1090 EXC3? Guida alla marcatura CE delle strutture in acciaio","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorie di corrosività C1–C5 e CX: scegliere il ciclo di verniciatura per l’acciaio saldato","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Produzione di travi a cassone: sequenza di saldatura, diaframmi e lamiera di chiusura","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Carpenteria metallica: dalla progettazione al montaggio"},"nl":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Stalen voetgangersbruggen produceren: EXC3, zichtlassen, corrosiebescherming en transportdelen | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Productie van stalen voetgangersbruggen, viaducten en verbindingsbruggen tussen hallen: uitvoeringsklasse EN 1090, laskwaliteit en NDO, zichtvlakken, ISO 12944-bescherming, transportdelen en proefmontage.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Stalen voetgangersbruggen","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Productgids · Staalbouw","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Stalen voetgangersbruggen produceren: EXC3, zichtlassen, corrosiebescherming en transportdelen","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Voetgangersbruggen","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min lezen","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Gemeentelijke loopbruggen, park- en waterovergangen, gesloten verbindingsbruggen tussen fabriekshallen: stalen voetgangersbruggen zijn dragend en zichtbaar tegelijk. Van de producent wordt beide verwacht: brugkwaliteit in lassen en documentatie, en een verzorgde uitstraling voor een openbaar bouwwerk.</p>\n<h2>Uitvoeringsklasse en documenten</h2>\n<p>In Europa worden bruggen meestal in EXC3 volgens EN 1090-2 voorgeschreven; het project bepaalt de klasse (zie <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Dat vraagt lascoördinatie, traceerbaarheid, gekwalificeerde procedures en hogere NDO-percentages. Bij levering hoort een fabricagedossier met certificaten, WPS/WPQR, lassercertificaten, NDO-, maat- en coatingrapporten.</p>\n<h2>Draagsysteem</h2>\n<p>Vakwerk, I-liggers of kokerliggers (zie <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">kokerliggers</a>). Trillingen en loopcomfort zijn ontwerpvragen voor de constructeur. De producent maakt doorsneden, zeeg en verbindingen volgens tekening.</p>\n<h2>Zichtlassen en oppervlakken</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Naadprofiel, spatten en slijpgraad van zichtbare lassen in de order vastleggen; \"net uiterlijk\" alleen volstaat niet.</li>\n<li>Afronden van randen en lasvoorbereiding bepalen de levensduur van de coating (zie <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">ISO 8501-3-graden</a>).</li>\n<li>Waterzakken en open holtes in het ontwerp vermijden.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Corrosiebescherming</h2>\n<p>Het systeem wordt volgens ISO 12944 vastgelegd met corrosiviteitscategorie en duurzaamheid (zie <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944-categorieën</a>). Duplex (verzinken plus coating) is gangbaar; de badmaat beïnvloedt de opdeling.</p>\n<h2>Transport en montage</h2>\n<p>De brug wordt opgedeeld in weg- en badgeschikte delen; verbindingen worden gebout of op locatie gelast. Bij kritische projecten controleert een proefmontage in de werkplaats de pasvorm; delen worden in montagevolgorde gemerkt.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen brugliggers en vakwerkstaven volgens tekening; VT en UT voert ons ISO 9712 niveau 2-personeel uit. Snijden, verzinken, coaten, transport en montage coördineren we met partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Staalconstructie →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke EN 1090-klasse voor een loopbrug?</h3><p>Het project bepaalt die; in Europa vaak EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hoe specificeer je zichtlassen?</h3><p>Naadprofiel, spatten en slijpgraad expliciet in de order.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke bescherming?</h3><p>Een systeem volgens ISO 12944; duplex is gangbaar.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hoe wordt vervoerd?</h3><p>In weg- en badgeschikte delen, op locatie verbonden.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Een voetgangersbrug gepland?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Stuur ontwerp en werktekeningen; we offreren de productie.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_exc3_h1":"Wat is EN 1090 EXC3? Gids voor CE-markering van constructiestaal","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 corrosiviteitscategorieën C1–C5 en CX: coatingsysteem kiezen voor gelast staal","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Kokerliggers produceren: lasvolgorde, schotten en de sluitplaat","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Staalbouw: van ontwerp tot montage"},"no":{"blog_p100_footbridge_title":"Produksjon av gangbruer i stål: EXC3, synlige sveiser, korrosjonsvern og transportseksjoner | ArmaWeld","blog_p100_footbridge_meta_desc":"Produksjon av gangbruer, overganger og forbindelsesbruer mellom haller: utførelsesklasse EN 1090, sveisekvalitet og NDT, synlige flater, ISO 12944-korrosjonsvern, transportseksjoner og prøvemontasje.","blog_p100_footbridge_og_title":"Gangbruer i stål","blog_p100_footbridge_tag":"Produktguide · Stålkonstruksjon","blog_p100_footbridge_h1":"Produksjon av gangbruer i stål: EXC3, synlige sveiser, korrosjonsvern og transportseksjoner","blog_p100_footbridge_breadcrumb3":"Gangbruer","blog_p100_footbridge_read":"7 min lesing","blog_p100_footbridge_body":"<p>Kommunale gangbruer, kryssinger i parker og over elver, lukkede forbindelsesbruer mellom fabrikkhaller: gangbruer i stål er både bærende og godt synlige. Produsenten forventes å levere bru-kvalitet i sveising og dokumentasjon, og et ryddig uttrykk som passer et offentlig byggverk.</p>\n<h2>Utførelsesklasse og dokumenter</h2>\n<p>I Europa spesifiseres bruer normalt i EXC3 etter EN 1090-2; prosjektet fastsetter klassen (se <a href=\"en-1090-exc3-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC3</a>). Det krever sveisekoordinering, sporbarhet, kvalifiserte prosedyrer og høyere NDT-omfang. Leveransen omfatter en produksjonsdokumentasjon med sertifikater, WPS/WPQR, sveisersertifikater, NDT-, mål- og overflateprotokoller.</p>\n<h2>Bæresystem</h2>\n<p>Fagverk, I-bjelker eller kassebjelker (se <a href=\"kutu-kiris-box-girder-imalati.html\">kassebjelker</a>). Svingninger og gangkomfort er konstruktørens tema. Produsenten lager tverrsnitt, overhøyde og forbindelser etter tegning.</p>\n<h2>Synlige sveiser og flater</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sveiseprofil, sprut og slipegrad for synlige sveiser må angis i ordren; \"pent utseende\" alene holder ikke.</li>\n<li>Avrunding av kanter og sveiseforberedelse påvirker beleggets levetid (se <a href=\"iso-8501-3-boya-oncesi-kaynak-hazirligi-p1-p2-p3.html\">ISO 8501-3-grader</a>).</li>\n<li>Unngå vannlommer og åpne hulrom i konstruksjonen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Korrosjonsvern</h2>\n<p>Systemet defineres etter ISO 12944 med korrosivitetskategori og holdbarhet (se <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944-kategorier</a>). Duplex (forsinking pluss maling) er vanlig; karstørrelsen påvirker oppdelingen.</p>\n<h2>Transport og montasje</h2>\n<p>Brua deles i seksjoner som passer vei og forsinkingskar; skjøter utformes boltet eller sveiset på stedet. I kritiske prosjekter gjøres prøvemontasje på verkstedet for å kontrollere skjøtene, og delene merkes i montasjerekkefølge.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser brubjelker og fagverksstaver etter tegning; VT og UT utføres av vårt ISO 9712 nivå 2-personell. Kutting, forsinking, maling, transport og montasje koordineres med partnere. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stålkonstruksjon →</a></p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken EN 1090-klasse for en gangbru?</h3><p>Prosjektet fastsetter den; i Europa ofte EXC3.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvordan spesifiseres synlige sveiser?</h3><p>Sveiseprofil, sprut og slipegrad angis i ordren.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilket korrosjonsvern?</h3><p>Et system etter ISO 12944; duplex er vanlig.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvordan transporteres brua?</h3><p>I seksjoner som passer vei og kar, skjøtet på stedet.</p></div>","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_h3":"Har du et gangbruprosjekt?","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_p":"Send prosjekt og verkstedtegninger; vi gir tilbud på produksjon.","blog_p100_footbridge_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_exc3_h1":"Hva er EN 1090 EXC3? Guide til CE-merking av konstruksjonsstål","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 korrosivitetskategorier C1–C5 og CX: velge malingssystem for sveiset stål","blog_p99_boxgirder_h1":"Produksjon av kassebjelker: sveiserekkefølge, skott og lukkeplaten","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stålkonstruksjonsproduksjon: Fra design til montasje"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
